<title>USA: Clean tankers fixtures and enquiries - 2218 GMT.</title>
<headline>Clean tankers fixtures and enquiries - 2218 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>FIXTURES</p>
<p>UK/CONT -</p>
<p>Tiger 35 mogas 6/10 Ventspils/USAC W135 Vitol.</p>
<p>Prodicos 35 mogas 5/10 ARA/USAC or USG/Caribs W130 Vitol.</p>
<p>Athenian Fidelity 25 prompt Cont/Med W190 cnr.</p>
<p>WESTERN HEMISPHERE -</p>
<p>Mormacsun 30 4/10 Caribs/USAC W195 Axel Johnson.</p>
<p>Port Alexandre 35 jet 10-12/10 Caribs/USAC rnr Adam.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
